{'symbol': 'FRC', 'date': '2022-03-14 08:00:00', 'title': 'FIRST REPUBLIC BANK BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPOINTS MIKE ROFFLER AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIRST REPUBLIC BANK (NYSE:FRC), A LEADING PRIVATE BANK AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS NAMED MIKE ROFFLER CEO OF THE COMPANY EFFECTIVE MARCH 13, 2022. ROFFLER WILL ALSO CONTINUE TO SERVE AS PRESIDENT AND BOARD MEMBER. GEORGE G.C. PARKER, ACTING CHAIRMAN AND BOARD MEMBER, SAID: “WE ARE EXCEEDINGLY PLEASED TO APPOINT MIKE AS FIRST REPUBLIC'S CEO. MIKE FULLY EMBODIES OUR CULTURE, HAS A DEEP KNOWLEDGE OF OUR BUSINESS MODEL, AN"}